sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Person
    participant SQ as SonarQube
    participant K as Keycloak (realm qa)
    participant E as Entra ID

    U->>SQ: GET https://sonar.qa.disasterproject.com
    SQ-->>U: redirect with SAML AuthnRequest
    U->>K: /realms/qa/protocol/saml
    Note over K: Identity Provider Redirector<br/>defaultProvider = entra
    K-->>U: redirect to Entra (OIDC, code flow)
    U->>E: login · MFA · conditional access
    E-->>U: redirect with code
    U->>K: /realms/qa/broker/entra/endpoint?code=…
    K->>E: token endpoint · private_key_jwt (back-channel, Cloud NAT)
    E-->>K: id_token with roles claim
    Note over K: roles claim → entra_roles attribute<br/>syncMode FORCE
    K-->>U: signed SAMLResponse (groups)
    U->>SQ: POST /oauth2/callback/saml
    Note over SQ: validates the signature with<br/>saml_idp_certificate
    SQ-->>U: session with team-* groups
